  id="sc-player"
  width="100%"
  height="166"
  scrolling="no"
  frameborder="no"
  src="https://w.soundcloud.com/player/?url=https%3A//api.soundcloud.com/tracks/TRACK_ID&auto_play=false&hide_related=false&show_comments=true&show_user=true&show_reposts=false&visual=true">
</iframe>
```

Replace `TRACK_ID` with the numeric ID you get from the API (`/tracks/:id`). The widget works **without any extra authentication** for public tracks, but if you need to play **private or user‑specific tracks**, you must pass the token:

