## 3. Adding the URL in the SoundCloud Developer Console

1. Log in to the **SoundCloud Developer Dashboard**.  
2. Open your app (or create a new one).  
3. Find the **“Redirect URIs”** (or “Callback URLs”) field.  
4. Paste the exact URL you decided on (e.g., `https://mywebsite.com/auth/soundcloud/callback`).  
5. Save the changes.  

